{
  vertexes: [
    {
      id: "1"
      L: Page
      P: {
        public: true
        fns: return { enabled: () => true }
        title: Attendra – Staff Time & Shift Tracking
        key: Home
        url: /
        props:
          '''return {
  isNoPermissionCheck: true
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "2"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "meta",
  name: "description",
  content: "Staff time and shift tracking for Shopify store teams. Manage employees and roles, track hours, and review time records inside Shopify Admin."
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "3"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: ${args.theme.var.spacing?.lg || "2rem"};
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text};
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  ._id { padding: ${args.theme.var.spacing?.md || "1rem"}; }
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 2
        componentName: Html
        props: '''return { as: "main" }'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "4"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id { margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; }`;'''
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props: '''return { as: "h1", text: "Attendra" }'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "5"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id { margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0; color: ${args.theme.var.color.text_light_500}; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; }`;'''
        displayOrder: 2
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text: Staff time and shift tracking for Shopify store teams. Manage **employees and roles**, track hours, and review daily/weekly time — inside Shopify Admin.
        props: '''return { as: "div" }'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "6"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css: '''return `._id { margin-top: 1.5rem; }`;'''
        displayOrder: 3
        componentName: Html
        props: '''return { as: "section" }'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "7"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css: '''return `._id { margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.25rem; }`;'''
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props: '''return { as: "h2", text: "MVP features" }'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "8"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css: '''return `._id { margin: 0; color: ${args.theme.var.color.text}; line-height: 1.7; }`;'''
        displayOrder: 2
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text:
          '''- **Employees**: add staff, roles, active/inactive
- **Clock in/out**: embedded admin; staff portal via Dashboard **Portal Url**
- **Time logs**: clock-in/out timestamps + total hours
- **Dashboard**: who’s clocked in, late arrivals, total hours today
- **Settings**: timezone, late threshold, auto clock-out

Need help? See [FAQ](/faq) or [Documentation](/docs).'''
        props: '''return { as: "div", textType: "markdown" }'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "layout"
      L: PageLayout
      P: {
        componentName: ShopifyLayout
      }
    }
  ]
